           CLIENT_DATABASES/<client>/QR_PROMO), menu cards, MENU_ITEM_ENSURE, approvals, cash book, Tally, steward control …
           live in menu-card-qr-promo.gs and only worked while that file was the LAST file (it wrapped doPost). Now any
           action this router does not know is handed to that file directly, already session-checked — file order no
           longer matters, and the dashboard stops trying 4 deployments one after another. */
        if (typeof bnxMenuPromoRoute_ === 'function') {
          let mp = null;
