 *    this project. Both routes therefore answered {success:false, error:'DSR_ITEM_GROUP_ENGINE_NOT_INSTALLED'} although the
 *    TRANSACTION_DB tab DSR_ITEM_GROUP_CALC is filled, so dsr-client fell back to its old item-group logic.
