  };
})();

/**
 * DSR ITEM-GROUP ENGINE  v3  (2026-10-18)
 * Builds the DSR revenue rows straight from BILL_ITEMS, bill by bill, and writes one row per business day to the tab
 * DSR_ITEM_GROUP_CALC in each client's TRANSACTION DB. dsr-client.html reads that tab.
 *
 * v3 changes (against the owner's DSR for 16-Oct-2026):
 *   - NEW column DISCOUNT = discount of BILLED bills only (NC / zero-total bills excluded). 16-Oct: 11,065 (owner) instead of 24,899.
 *   - Hourly trigger is now cheap: it rebuilds only when BILL_MASTER / BILL_ITEMS / DSR_ITEM_GROUP_DAILY changed (row counts),
 *     and at least every 6 h (edited bills do not change row counts). This took the heavy full-sheet scan off the server.
 *   - Optional Script property DSR_IGC_MRP_IGNORE = 2026-10-15,2026-10-16  → ignore DSR_ITEM_GROUP_DAILY.LIQUOR_MRP on those days
 *     (the owner's MTD Liquor MRP counts only 10, 11 and 14-Oct; the sheet also holds estimates for 15 / 16-Oct).
 *   - Everything else (rules, group mapping, API) unchanged from v2.
 *
 * v2 — ANY ITEM GROUP, ANY CLIENT
 *   LIQUOR / BAR / ALCOHOL / WINE / BEER / SPIRITS       → Liquor      (… MRP / BTL group → Liquor MRP)
 *   FOOD / KITCHEN / ADD-ONS / DESSERT / STARTERS …      → Food
 *   BEVERAGE / DRINKS / MOCKTAIL / JUICE / SOFT / TEA …  → Beverage
 *   HUKKA / HOOKAH / SHISHA / TOBACCO / HASH FREEZER     → Hukka
 *   ANY OTHER group gets ITS OWN DSR row (GROUPS_JSON, total in EXTRA_GROUPS). Others = service charge only.
 *   Per-client override: Script property DSR_GROUP_MAP_<clientId>, JSON e.g. {"FRUIT SALE":"FOOD","BAKERY":"OWN"}
 *     values: LIQUOR · LIQUOR_MRP · FOOD · BEVERAGE · HUKKA · OWN
 *   Several clients: Script property DSR_IGC_CLIENTS = CL00010,CL00011,…
 *
 * RULES (per bill, then summed per day):
 *   - Skip CANCELLED / VOID bills. Bills with GRAND_TOTAL <= 0 (NC) add no sale and no discount.
 *   - Pre-tax target = GRAND_TOTAL − TAX_AMOUNT − SERVICE_CHARGE_GST_AMOUNT − ROUND_OFF − SERVICE_CHARGE_AMOUNT.
 *   - Item value = QUANTITY × DISCOUNTED_RATE. Items MORE than the target are scaled down to it.
 *   - Bills with no item rows: shared over the groups using that day's DSR_ITEM_GROUP_DAILY row, else NO_ITEM_SALE.
 *   - Liquor MRP = a Liquor-MRP group if the client has one, else DSR_ITEM_GROUP_DAILY.LIQUOR_MRP (taken out of Liquor).
 *   - Others = service charge. Tax = TAX_AMOUNT + SERVICE_CHARGE_GST_AMOUNT. Round off = Net − Gross − Tax.
 *
 * RUN:  RUN_19_BuildDsrItemGroups()        → builds every day for every client now.
 *       RUN_20_InstallDsrItemGroupTrigger()→ hourly check (rebuilds only when data changed).
 *       RUN_21_ListItemGroups()            → logs each client's item groups and the DSR row each goes to.
 * Nothing in BILL_MASTER / BILL_ITEMS is changed.
 */
