/* 2026-10-27: fixed business-day repair for CLIENT 10.
 * Run RUN_28_Check26OctoberBilling to inspect; RUN_28_Fix26OctoberBilling to apply.
 * Creation timestamps are authoritative. No invoice numbers, amounts or statuses are changed.
